Like previous Amazon devices, this device was filed as a "Digital Media Streaming Device" :under a grantee code of a random LLC (''Verdegrass LLC''). <!-- {{FCC ST|12/04/2018|indexme.}} ⚠ --> {{See also|Amazon Fire TV Devices}}
